SKUNKPORT: experimental, untested on HDXI. Pinned to kitty 0.48.2: newer releases (0.49+) need the
slang shader compiler (slangc), which is not available on HDXI. Wayland only (the X11 backend is
patched out) and linked without libGL: it needs the mesa skunkport at runtime for EGL (software
rendering or virgl, or whatever GL your mesa build supports). Needs Go (devel-go, about 70 MB
download). The build downloads Go modules from the network and takes a long time. Unsupported;
may break.
